  "mermaidCatalogTemplateStateDiagram": "stateDiagram-v2\n  state \"保留中\" as pending\n  state \"処理中\" as processing\n  state \"完了\" as completed\n  state \"失敗\" as failed\n  [*] --> pending\n  pending --> processing\n  processing --> completed\n  processing --> failed\n  failed --> pending\n  completed --> [*]",
